```text
  accounts 0..4 (each own root)
    union(0,2) → root0 owns {0,2}
    union(1,3) → root1 owns {1,3}
    connected(0,1)? root0 vs root1 → FALSE
    union(2,1)  → merge by rank → root0 owns {0,1,2,3}
    connected(0,1)? same root → TRUE
